            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#526578' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Station rankings and income averages: at least 500,000 annual riders. Station-time rankings: at least 100,000 riders in that time period.
Income bars show the unweighted average station rate. All rate denominators refer to 2025 ridership.
Complaint rates describe reported complaints relative to ridership; they are not estimates of an individual rider&apos;s risk.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#d6dee5' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
